Backport of https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/159725 ([3.15] gh-159136),
merged to the 3.15 branch on 2026-10-29 and first shipped in 3.15.3. On the
free-threaded build, setting a function's __name__/__qualname__/__module__/__doc__
stopped the world since 3.14.7 (gh-154826/gh-154851), so functools.wraps() from
several threads ran hundreds of times slower. The fix uses the per-object critical
section plus _PyObject_XSetRefDelayed(), like the generator __name__ setter.
Documentation and NEWS hunks dropped. Remove when cpython-3.15 is >= 3.15.3.

